{{rfd|a string of three separate morphemes; does not mean "I"}}

==Welsh==
'''dwin''' (''contraction of'' '''[[dw#Welsh|dw]]''', '''[[i#Welsh|i]]''', ''and'' '''[[yn#Welsh|yn]]''')

# [[I'm]], ''with following [[yn#Welsh|complement marker]]''.

===Usage note===
This phrase is more properly written ''dw i'n'' or ''dwi'n''.